        <mxCell id="dl" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fadbd8;strokeColor=#c0392b;" value="🔴 DEEP LEARNING&#xa;- Epoki&#xa;- Batch size&#xa;- Learning rate schedule&#xa;- Dropout, weight decay&#xa;- Early stopping&#xa;- TensorBoard / learning curves&#xa;- Brak cv_results_ w tej formie" vertex="1">
